df_basic_summary

# NA.prc: Percentage of missing values (NA)
# mean: mean (average)
# sd: Standard deviation
# se: Standard error of the mean
# md: Median
# trimmed: Trimmed mean (usually with 10% trimmed from each end)
# range: Minimum and maximum values (displayed as 'min–max')
# iqr: Interquartile range (Q3–Q1)
# skew: Skewness (measure of distribution asymmetry)

